    "text": "A cyclist starts from the point $P$ of a circular ground of radius $2 \\mathrm{~km}$ and travels along its circumference to the point $\\mathrm{S}$. The displacement of a cyclist is:\n<img src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/pyq/jee_main/7gNwPftvaOaM674Z102VnxgoRgft0WMdVCEm8TTjR0o.original.fullsize.png\"><br>",
    "image": null
